# Line endings are normalized on commit. A whole-file upload from a Windows
# editor is how examples/tutor/workflow.py, core/types.py, core/code_exec.py and
# two tests landed with CRLF on the dev/rewrite line: every line then reads as
# modified, so the diff against the fork point was +6497/-5959 on workflow.py
# for a real change of +590/-52, and the unification merge conflicted on
# essentially every hunk instead of on the handful that actually collided.
*.py    text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.sh    text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
